+):
+    """Get direction-preserving immediate neighbours of NESTED HEALPix cells.
+
+    Parameters
+    ----------
+    ipix : `numpy.ndarray`
+        The NESTED HEALPix cell indexes.
+    depth : int
+        The depth of the HEALPix cells.
